          "title": "On similarity related the genetic code",
          "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8362198",
          "publication_date": "2016-06-20",
          "description": "<p>We consider a few kinds of distance for description of (dis)similarity in the genetic code. We point out relevance of ultrametrics, and especially p-adic distance, for modeling the genetic code and investigation of similarity between sequences of nucleotides, codons or amino acids.</p>",
